<title>INDONESIA: Dharmala Sakti net up to 39.22 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Dharmala Sakti net up to 39.22 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   39.22 vs 35.43</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah) 121 vs 109</p>
<p>    Revenues			  256.41 vs 187.75</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 60.84 vs 51.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   63.96 vs 55.08</p>
<p>    Profit before minority interest   49.89 vs 43.51</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		    152.59 vs 121.77</p>
<p>Note: PT Dharmala Sakti Sejahtera, a member of the Dharmala Group, is an investment holding company.</p>
</text>
